# ── Runtime lives on the box, never here ──────────────────────────
# (see HOME.md — the two-machine split)
models/
checkpoints/
runs/
# audio.cpp build + Python venvs (17 GB on the box), and the test sets (1.4 GB)
engines/
data/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.ckpt

# ── Generated audio lives on the box ──────────────────────────────
# A repository is not an audio host. listening/ commits the MANIFEST
# and the SCORES; the waveforms stay in runs/ on the box and are
# fetched when a listening test is actually run.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.mp4

# ── The one exception: clips a chapter actually cites ──────────────
# planning/KB-STYLE.md §2 — <= 15 seconds, <= 1 MB, compressed, and
# only if a page references it. check.py enforces all three.
!knowledge-base/audio/*.mp3
!knowledge-base/audio/*.ogg

# ── Measurements ARE committed — they are the data the tables read.
#    Raw logs and GPU samples are not; they live in runs/ on the box.
*.log
gpu-samples/

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env

# ── Scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scratch/
tmp/

# ── macOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# resource forks reached the box once and showed up inside agent
# prompts — selfhostllm/serve/README.md records what that cost.
.DS_Store
._*

# ── Secrets: never committed, even by accident ────────────────────
# Rule 10 (planning/QUEUE.md): a token lives in a mode-600 file, never argv.
.env.*
.auth-header
.aria-input
*.token
.netrc
*.pem
*.key

# ── Assistant / editor local files ────────────────────────────────
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Git artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bundle
*.orig

# ── The knowledge base lives only on the Mac, never on the box or GitHub ──
knowledge-base/
